* CM.BP
* Customer App
* Sample app for PyGui testing on sd
* This is as much a sample as a debug tool (to test out PYGUI) so do not expect a full blown app here!
*  There are a load of crt statements that do not need to be here!
* NOTE !!!!! This is a demo program, very little if any data validation is taking place!!!!
*
* Because we are running embedded within the sd app and it is possible the sd process could be alive for long periods of
*  time, we should clean up (set to None) any objects created either within the _setup.py or _step.py script.
* Also at some point the sd Python function PY_PYGUISTEP()  (sd_py_gui_step in sdext_py.c) should be passed the name of
*   the function defined in the _step.py script (in this example gui_step).  Currently it is hardcoded. 
*
* Suggested reading: SD GUI Python Cooperative Schedule.txt in the Documentation folder
* NOTE !!!!! This is a demo program, very little if any data validation is taking place!!!!
